# Rust backend

- Chess rules and legal moves: Shakmaty only.
- Keep Tauri commands thin: parse input, call `game` / `engine` / `db` / `repertoire`, return DTOs.
- Engine install/profiles/UCI in `engine/`; databases + `.mcidx` in `db/`; repertoire DAG/builder in `repertoire/`.
- One streaming analysis session (`AnalysisManager`); repertoire builder uses one-shot `get_best_move`.
- Position key for repertoire nodes: FEN without halfmove/fullmove clocks.
- Add crates with `cargo add` from `src-tauri` when CLI works.
